    {
      "post_id": "544326741674967042",
      "text": "Uber criticized for “off the charts” surge pricing during hostage crisis in Australia. http://t.co/OgTn7iAO1W http://t.co/qdX0m3uzWc",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:03:02 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544332808374988800",
      "text": "@JFBegin Le tweet qui a enflammé la tweetosphère: https://t.co/1AtyjYOUok\n@nycjim",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:27:09 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544363704071245824",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl The new and disruptive are always subject to a ridiculous amount of criticism.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:29:55 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443623004390072e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544327089965383680",
      "text": "@nycjim encouraging drivers to evacuate people from the area https://t.co/XJemT5QNot",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:04:26 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544326917839523840",
      "text": "@nycjim capitalising off a hostage situation isn't a good look",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:03:44 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544333926920376320",
      "text": "#PrivilegeComplaints RT @nycjim: Uber criticized for “off the charts” surge pricing during hostage crisis in Australia.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:31:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544359107621580800",
      "text": "@jbones3000 I imagine if I was stuck where I felt unsafe or wanted to get somewhere to check on someone, I would think it was a necessity.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:11:39 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435834933755904e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544356239384510464",
      "text": "@jbones3000 and a local store brought water bottles around selling them at $3 a piece (sold for .75 then). For me ethics matter.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:00:15 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435545150970266e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544358349337559040",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl +1 but I see transportation apps as categorically different from necessities. Drivers are free to drive pro bono on their own.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:08:38 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443578408159355e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544332882366308352",
      "text": "@nycjim they profit from natural disasters and death. Is it called surge pricing? Something like that.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:27:27 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544332320724234241",
      "text": "Wow. RT @nycjim: Uber criticized for “off the charts” surge pricing during hostage crisis in Australia. http://t.co/3w0SWDEe29",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:25:13 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544365148610519040",
      "text": "@jbones3000 Yeah, and I know what smell hell I'm getting into with a cab! I would expect the same from them (on maintaining same fair).",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:35:39 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443636777058468e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544359313033396224",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl FWIW It would behoove Uber to have a human press the OK button when surge pricing reaches a certain level.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:12:28 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435834933755904e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544360291623239680",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl I just reject the idea that Uber has an special responsibility for others. How many ordinary drivers volunteered to give rides?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:16:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443591076215808e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544331261943111682",
      "text": "@nycjim GTFO Uber! Come back Uber, we need you!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:21:00 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544356635515564032",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl the implication being that charging a certain price for a service is unethical. I respectfully reject this notion.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:01:50 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435623938451046e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544363677705846784",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl in some ways, it's a shame that we even expect them to have a good image. Society never expected so much of taxicabs.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:29:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443623004390072e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544353463153725441",
      "text": "@briarwoodsman @nycjim @jackhealyNYT I agree. It's not good for PR but its really not different than a pricier flight into a high risk zone.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:49:13 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432922222371226e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544360747401510913",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl probably would be cheaper for them in the long run.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:18:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44360546733396e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544361266547290113",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl bad press is expensive, particularly when every taxi company and municipal government is looking for excuses to shut you down.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:20:14 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44360546733396e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544361880186535936",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl #MediaProblems",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:22:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443614819289784e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544356981004595200",
      "text": "@jbones3000 Clearly lost have my tweet! Was in a terrible flood when a levee broke..uphill both ways ..in the snow..done whining!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:03:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435545150970266e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544338743306772481",
      "text": ".@nycjim @meanwhilefl Uber asks a price. You say yes or no. That's every business ever. Why is this news?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:50:44 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544327714849579008",
      "text": "Hi @nycjim we're putting the word out that Sydney owned ONTAP has no surge pricing during the siege. http://t.co/a350C6yRa0 pls RT",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:06:54 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544355005185404928",
      "text": "@jbones3000 @nycjim I understand how they price &amp; know some companies choose to suspend during a crisis.Good to know who does and doesn't.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:55:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435365937165926e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544328543480860673",
      "text": "@nycjim Profiteering and Gouging !",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:10:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544330919180763137",
      "text": "Strike 3 Uber. RT @nycjim: “off the charts” surge pricing during hostage crisis in Australia. http://t.co/tFLp3xJzTw http://t.co/qsjYyC9Dhw",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:19:38 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544353659371659264",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl @nycjim It's common knowledge that Uber prices are based on scarcity. This is yellow journalism.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:50:00 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443529354222305e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544357840815935488",
      "text": "@jbones3000 Always happy to disagree! I saw price gouging and people do without. Never forget that...",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:06:37 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44356635515564e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544355451509702657",
      "text": "@meanwhilefl @nycjim Uber has already given refunds and free rides to those affected by the surge prices in this area.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:57:07 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443550051854049e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544362300439007232",
      "text": "@jbones3000 Yeah, they don't seem to be on point with this whole image thing.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:24:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443612665472901e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544360546733395968",
      "text": "@jbones3000 No shit, right!?!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:17:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443593130333962e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544356437598937088",
      "text": "@jbones3000 @nycjim Excellent!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:01:03 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4435545150970266e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544361481928978434",
      "text": "@jbones3000 I don't think just Uber or for free. I'm sure we'll hear comp and people who did offer..always hear bad first..",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:21:05 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443602916232397e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544331912001507328",
      "text": "@ontapsydney @nycjim you deserve a promotion. Uber is disgusting",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:23:35 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44327714849579e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544329222223712256",
      "text": "@nycjim @jackhealyNYT Free market economics. What could be wrong with that? (Besides the visuals.)",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:12:54 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544352935422230528",
      "text": "@jbones3000 @nycjim Companies business practices are reported on all the time. I like to read about it..so news.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:47:08 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443387433067725e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544335388861423616",
      "text": "@nycjim @choox75 @therealroseanne will love that.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:37:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432674167496704e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544355587405131776",
      "text": "@jbones3000 Many moons ago my family was caught in a huge flood.Wasn't supposed to hit us but a levee broke..no time for prep 1/2",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:57:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443387433067725e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    }
